  m_text: '

    All prizes are for combinations of a kind.

    All prizes are for
    combinations left to

    right, except scatters. Scatter symbols

    trigger
    bonuses at any position on the reels.

    Line wins and bonus winnings are added

    together.
    Highest win only paid on each

    selected line. Highest value bonus awarded

    per
    scatter combination.

    The paytable always shows the prizes for

    the currently
    selected bet.

    Malfunction voids all pays and plays.'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
