  m_text: '

    3, 4 or 5 Ball bonus symbols anywhere

    in view during the basic
    game award the

    Ball Pickem Bonus.

    Pick jewels to reveal prizes. keep
    picking

    until you reveal collect or reach the

    maximum win for the bonus.

    2,
    3 or 4 Ball symbils on 1-4 reels initiate

    the respin feature on the fifth
    reel.

    The prize is based on your total bet.

    Max win from the bonus
    is total bet x500.'
